    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through a total of 180 vibrant levels filled with a wide variety of challenges.  Fly your Cosmic Cat to their comfy green cat bed on each level without crashing into the walls, obstacles or enemies.  There a lots of different pickups through out the game that offer abilities and weapons to see you through.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873550/extras/ff57ee68899d52ba61a4ccf7f6d3c894.poster.avif?t=1755021683\" width=426 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873550/extras/ff57ee68899d52ba61a4ccf7f6d3c894.webm?t=1755021683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >120 Unique Collectable Cards: For you level explorers out there, each main level has a collectable card based on a something in the game.  They will be easy to find in the beginning but will become harder to find later in secret areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873550/extras/06aa3684a8b49b1b250c19bb5d6e5573.poster.avif?t=1755021683\" width=426 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873550/extras/06aa3684a8b49b1b250c19bb5d6e5573.webm?t=1755021683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2605\u00a0\u00a0<strong>Gold Stars\u00a0 \u2192\u00a0 Unlock Playable Cats:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completing a level fast enough and you'll be rewarded a Gold Star\u2014 which will randomly unlock one of 120 playable Cosmic Cats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2605\u00a0\u00a0<strong>Silver Stars\u00a0 \u2192\u00a0 Arcade Coins:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finish a level at a decent pace and you'll be rewarded a Silver Star - you'll be rewarded with an Arcade Coin, which you can save up to spend to unlock 5 different arcade minigames (Cat Flap, Cat Walker, Catcher, Catapult and Cats Eye) and also an extra 60 levels in the 2nd campaign (Cosmic Kitten).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2605\u00a0\u00a0<strong>Bronze Stars\u00a0 \u2192\u00a0 Progression:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you don't want to race against the clock, you can switch off or ignore the timer and take as long as you want and you can still earn a Bronze Star which unlocks the next level until you complete the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873550/extras/fc30e3ba5c98d3b91f66b2a96f60d316.avif?t=1755021683\" width=800 height=449 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Content Creation Friendly</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re welcome to livestream, record, and monetize gameplay footage from <i>Cosmic Cat</i>. All music and sound effects were created by me and are safe for streaming.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wishlist and Follow Cosmic Cat to get ready for the launch!</h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through a total of 180 vibrant levels filled with a wide variety of challenges.  Fly your Cosmic Cat to their comfy green cat bed on each level without crashing into the walls, obstacles or enemies.  There a lots of different pickups through out the game that offer abilities and weapons to see you through.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873550/extras/ff57ee68899d52ba61a4ccf7f6d3c894.poster.avif?t=1755021683\" width=426 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873550/extras/ff57ee68899d52ba61a4ccf7f6d3c894.webm?t=1755021683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >120 Unique Collectable Cards: For you level explorers out there, each main level has a collectable card based on a something in the game.  They will be easy to find in the beginning but will become harder to find later in secret areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873550/extras/06aa3684a8b49b1b250c19bb5d6e5573.poster.avif?t=1755021683\" width=426 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873550/extras/06aa3684a8b49b1b250c19bb5d6e5573.webm?t=1755021683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2605\u00a0\u00a0<strong>Gold Stars\u00a0 \u2192\u00a0 Unlock Playable Cats:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completing a level fast enough and you'll be rewarded a Gold Star\u2014 which will randomly unlock one of 120 playable Cosmic Cats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2605\u00a0\u00a0<strong>Silver Stars\u00a0 \u2192\u00a0 Arcade Coins:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finish a level at a decent pace and you'll be rewarded a Silver Star - you'll be rewarded with an Arcade Coin, which you can save up to spend to unlock 5 different arcade minigames (Cat Flap, Cat Walker, Catcher, Catapult and Cats Eye) and also an extra 60 levels in the 2nd campaign (Cosmic Kitten).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2605\u00a0\u00a0<strong>Bronze Stars\u00a0 \u2192\u00a0 Progression:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you don't want to race against the clock, you can switch off or ignore the timer and take as long as you want and you can still earn a Bronze Star which unlocks the next level until you complete the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873550/extras/fc30e3ba5c98d3b91f66b2a96f60d316.avif?t=1755021683\" width=800 height=449 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Content Creation Friendly</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re welcome to livestream, record, and monetize gameplay footage from <i>Cosmic Cat</i>. All music and sound effects were created by me and are safe for streaming.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wishlist and Follow Cosmic Cat to get ready for the launch!</h2>",
    "short_description": "Fly one of 121 Cosmic\u202fCats in 180 vibrant 3D side\u2011scrolling levels\u2014navigate past obstacles, outsmart enemies &amp; wield a variety of weapons and power\u2011ups. Explore to uncover hidden collectible cards, take it easy or race the clock to earn stars that unlock new cats, levels and four arcade minigames!",
